/P 218 0 R
/E (At our core, we are committed to fostering the progress of Hispanics in engineering and science. Through initiatives focused on academic excellence, professional development, service, and community, we strive to create a nurturing environment of growth and success.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
276 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 218 0 R
/E (The Society of Hispanic Professional Engineers offers numerous avenues for corporate engagement and support throughout the 2025-2026 academic year. Our calendar is full of impactful events including conferences, workshops, study breaks, community service projects, outreach initiatives, and enjoyable social activities. While some of these events have become cherished traditions over the years, others have been carefully curated to align with our chapter's evolving needs and aspirations. As we gear up for the year ahead, our objective is to gain recognition from our regional and national peers for our efforts to increase community membership. Your sponsorship will empower our club to enhance and expand our community programs without compromising our current budget or continuously needing to fundraise.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
277 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
